{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"roleHeading":"Class","symbolKind":"class","title":"OrangeTheme","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeTheme"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeTheme"}],"externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B5ThemeC","role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange"]]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeTheme\/init(borders:colors:colorModes:charts:effects:elevations:fonts:grids:opacities:dimensions:sizes:spaces:badge:bar:bulletList:button:checkbox:chip:controlItem:divider:icon:link:pinCodeInput:quantityInput:radioButton:selectInput:skeleton:switch:tag:inputTag:textArea:textInput:resourcesBundle:name:fontFamily:tuning:)"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeTheme"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Usages","level":1,"anchor":"Usages"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any Orange products must use this theme. It provides core and Orange colors and any elements for sizings, spacings and dimensions for example."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The system font families are used; no "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helevetica"}]},{"type":"text","text":" font family is embeded nor providd  by OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This theme also provides colors charts tokens."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme can be got through environment variable:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Integration","level":2,"anchor":"Integration"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To use this theme, inject it to your view using "},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and get it through environment variable."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    @main","    struct YourApp: App {","        var body: some Scene {","            WindowGroup {","                OUDSThemeableView(theme: OrangeTheme()) {","                    \/\/ Your root view","                }","            }","        }","    }"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Theme tuning","level":2,"anchor":"Theme-tuning"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme can be customized a bit for more flexibility thanks to "},{"code":"Tuning","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" object."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You just need to give a predefined tuning configuration at theme init to build the one you need."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To apply the tuning:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Define your theme tuning","    let tuning = Tuning(hasRoundedButtons: true, hasRoundedTextInputs: true)","","    \/\/ Apply it to your theme","    let theme = OrangeTheme(tuning: tuning)","    \/\/ Or in one line","    let theme = OrangeTheme(tuning: Tuning(hasRoundedButtons: true, hasRoundedTextInputs: true))","","    \/\/ Or apply predefined tunings","    let orangeFranceTheme = OrangeTheme(tuning: Tuning.OrangeFrance)","    let orangeBusinessTheme = OrangeTheme(tuning: Tuning.OrangeBusiness)","    let maxitTheme = OrangeTheme(tuning: Tuning.MaxIt)"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Typography","level":2,"anchor":"Typography"},{"type":"heading","text":"Helvetica Neue","level":3,"anchor":"Helvetica-Neue"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange brand strongly relies on the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helvetica Neue"}]},{"type":"text","text":" font family. Thus each Orange brand should, or must, use it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For iOS the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helvetica Neue"}]},{"type":"text","text":" font family is available at system level, so it is not needed to get it through external assets."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"By default an instance of "},{"code":"OrangeTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" uses as font family the token "},{"code":"OrangeBrandFontRawTokens.familyBrandDefault","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which is today "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helvetica Neue"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you want to use another font family, you will have to send the suitable token or the suitable font family."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, beware, iOS API relies also on the PostScript name of the font."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To be sure of the value to use, look at the font book of your device."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It is recommended to use the font raw tokens."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ The following instanciations work","    let orangeTheme = OrangeTheme()","    let orangeTheme = OrangeTheme(fontFamily: OrangeBrandFontRawTokens.familyBrandDefault)","    let orangeTheme = OrangeTheme(fontFamily: \"HelveticaNeue\") \/\/ Which is PostScript name of the font","    let orangeTheme = OrangeTheme(fontFamily: \"Helvetica Neue\") \/\/ Which is font family nale"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Helvetica Neue Arabic","level":3,"anchor":"Helvetica-Neue-Arabic"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helvetica Neue"}]},{"type":"text","text":" font family does not manage arabic alphabet but latin one, it is possible apply another font family to the theme like the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helvetica Neue Arabic"}]},{"type":"text","text":". This font family assets can be retrieved through the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PostScript name management has been implemented for this font family, thus the weight are managed and it is only needed to add the font assets to the project,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"register them and define the font family name to use."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    let orangeTheme = OrangeTheme(family: \"Helvetica Neue Arabic\")"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Tokens loading","level":2,"anchor":"Tokens-loading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can also use some tokens providers defined in your side, but they must match the same type as the one used on the themes (see "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["   \/\/ Use some already defined providers","   let borders = OrangeThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider()","   let sizes = OrangeThemeSizeSemanticTokensProvider()","   let spaces = OrangeThemeSpaceSemanticTokensProvider()","","   \/\/ For example, use your own provider of color semantic tokens","   \/\/ It must inherit from OrangeThemeBorderSemanticTokensProvider (which is instance of AllColorSemanticTokensProvider) or directly implement AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","   let colors = YourOwnColorSemanticTokensProvider()","","   \/\/ Some providers need other providers to use their tokens","   let button = OrangeThemeButtonComponentTokensProvider(sizes: sizes, borders: borders, colors: colors, spaces: spaces)","","   \/\/ But you can also use the providers as they are without assigning semantic tokens providers","   \/\/ and just use the default ones","   let badge = OrangeThemeBadgeComponentTokensProvider()","","   \/\/ Define in the end your theme by overriding some providers.","   \/\/ You can override all providers, or only some, or just keep the theme as is.","   \/\/ However you should uses thhese providers in a dedicated Orange theme subclass for clarity reasons.","   let yourOwnOrangeTheme = OrangeTheme(colors: colors, borders: borders, sizes: sizes, spaces: spaces, button: button, badge: badge)"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Tokens versions","level":2,"anchor":"Tokens-versions"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Core OUDS version: 1.9.0","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Core Orange version: 1.2.0","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Brand Orange version: 2.3.0","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.8.0"}]}],"name":"Since"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Group","title":"Group","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeBrandColorRawTokens","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeBrandFontRawTokens"]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangetheme"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme"]},{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/SQ","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme is the bsic, default, theme for any Orange products."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is an override of the abtract "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"must be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can override any properties from its superclass, and can be derived too."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeTheme"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"https://brand.orange.com/en/brand-basics/typography":{"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Brand website (authentication needed)"}],"url":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography","title":"Orange Brand website (authentication needed)"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/OUDSTheme":{"title":"OUDSTheme","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTheme"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This is a basic theme any theme must be a subclass off, or all themes must have as ancestor."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A Swift "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"class"},{"type":"text","text":" has been used so as to allow to easily override some attributes and have inheritance, without having for developers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to implement all tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Any properties of an overridable theme should be defined so as to provide defaults values."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"We allow this theme to be derivated and be overriden."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be seen as a kind of “abstract class” in "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"object oriented paradigm"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"theme contract"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" is not a "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"final"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" class, its type cannot be seen as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":", that is the reason why this conformity is unchecked."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/oudstheme","role":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeBrandFontRawTokens":{"title":"OrangeBrandFontRawTokens","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeBrandFontRawTokens"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeBrandFontRawTokens"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This enum helps to add new "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"font raw tokens"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" exclusive to this "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeTheme","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Such tokens are packed in a "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift enum"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to gather them in one object with the suitable namespace and avoid to have just constants in nothing else"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(i.e. publicly accessible from everywhere). More optimized than dimensionstruct_."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeBrandFontRawTokens","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangebrandfontrawtokens","role":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/s16SendableMetatypeP","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeTheme/init(borders:colors:colorModes:charts:effects:elevations:fonts:grids:opacities:dimensions:sizes:spaces:badge:bar:bulletList:button:checkbox:chip:controlItem:divider:icon:link:pinCodeInput:quantityInput:radioButton:selectInput:skeleton:switch:tag:inputTag:textArea:textInput:resourcesBundle:name:fontFamily:tuning:)":{"title":"init(borders:colors:colorModes:charts:effects:elevations:fonts:grids:opacities:dimensions:sizes:spaces:badge:bar:bulletList:button:checkbox:chip:controlItem:divider:icon:link:pinCodeInput:quantityInput:radioButton:selectInput:skeleton:switch:tag:inputTag:textArea:textInput:resourcesBundle:name:fontFamily:tuning:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"borders","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract31AllBorderSemanticTokensProviderP","text":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"colors","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllColorSemanticTokensProviderP","text":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"colorModes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract34AllColorModeSemanticTokensProviderP","text":"AllColorModeSemanticTokens